        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">γ-fiber texture</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>&lt;111&gt; || ND</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">γ-fiber texture component is a type of crystallographic texture which is quality of grain population, i.e., several grains, having a similar orientation (within a misorientation threshold) in relation to the material&apos;s reference frame: &lt;111&gt; family of crystallographic directions are oriented parallel to the normal direction (ND) of a sheet material, i.e., normal to the rolling plane.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


